&P273033 = ARM 02, 126 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. a-na be-li2-ia 
#tr.ts: ana bēliya 
#tr.en: To my lord 
2. qi2-bi2-ma 
#tr.ts: qibima 
#tr.en: speak! 
3. um-ma ia-si-im-su-mu-u2 
#tr.ts: umma yasim-sumu 
#tr.en: Thus Yasim-Sumû, 
4. _ARAD2_-ka-a-ma 
#tr.ts: waradkama 
#tr.en: your servant: 
